    "title": "Beautiful Arrangement",
    "category": "Recursion",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Suppose you have the integers from 1 to N. A permutation is called a beautiful arrangement if for every position i (1-indexed), either: The number at position i is divisible by i, or i is divisible by the number. Return the total number of beautiful arrangements.",
    "input": "Integer N",
    "output": "The number of beautiful arrangements.",
    "constraints": "1 <= N <= 15"
